# A mention of a Structure is not expanded (the author 2026-11-11, LMX_blog/2026-11-11.md#known-name-not-expanded; plan
# M11 5a): `Struct1: Struct2` gives Struct1 one atom, Struct2, and a path through it reads the field of Struct2 itself.
# Data is read whole, so the mention may stand above the declaration of Struct2.
Struct1: Struct2
Struct2:
    int: v 4
end: Struct2
int: seen Struct1\Struct2\v
